@startuml
title Timing Diagram: Soft Fault (DRONE_STUCK) Recovery

robust "Drone 1 State" as D1
concise "Scheduler" as SCH

@0
D1 is IDLE
SCH is LISTENING

@500
SCH is DISPATCHING
SCH -> D1 : UDP [CMD:1:MODERATE:DRONE_STUCK]

@1000
D1 is EN_ROUTE
SCH is LISTENING

@3000
D1 is SOFT_FAULT : Freezes mid-flight
D1 -> SCH : UDP [STATUS:SOFT_FAULT:DRONE_STUCK]
SCH is FAULT_RECOVERY : Strips fault & Re-queues mission

@3500
SCH is LISTENING

@6000
D1 is IDLE : 3000ms self-recovery complete
D1 -> SCH : UDP [STATUS:IDLE:NONE]
@enduml